* {{tl|background color}}
* {{tl|font color}} – allows setting both text and background color
* {{tl|coltit}} – colored table header cell
* {{tl|fake link}}
* Tools are available to help check whether the color contrast is sufficient, see [[Help:COLORTOOLS]].
