| Link to a Wikipedia page that exists and that you have visited || #795CB2 = rgb(121,92,178) ||style="text-align:center;"| {{color box|#795CB2}}|| #0B0080 = rgb(11,0,128) ||style="text-align:center;"| {{color box|#0B0080}} 
