| Link to a [[WP:STUB|very short article/stub]] within Wikipedia, but only if the user has set a preference option to format links to stubs in this way  || colspan=2 {{n/a|not yet defined}} || #772233 = rgb(119,34,51) ||style="text-align:center;"| {{color box|#772233}}
